# Git for Windows ships core.autocrlf=true, which materialises every file with
# CRLF on clone. Prettier's endOfLine default is "lf", so without this a fresh
# Windows clone fails format:check on every file before a line is edited.
#
# Normalise to LF in the index and check out LF on every platform regardless of
# the user's core.autocrlf. Binaries are auto-detected by text=auto and left
# untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
